00:59:00.207 --> 00:59:01.510
Thank you, Whim 'N Rhythm.

00:59:01.510 --> 00:59:04.000
That was really a beautiful performance.

00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:06.390
One of the requests from
several members of the committee

00:59:06.390 --> 00:59:09.150
was the next song from
the musical "Wicked."

00:59:09.150 --> 00:59:12.170
Cami and her friend Noelle
Mercer, Class of '21,

00:59:12.170 --> 00:59:14.300
vocalist and playwright, who has starred

00:59:14.300 --> 00:59:17.070
in several Yale productions, will sing

00:59:17.070 --> 00:59:19.397
this moving song called "For Good."

00:59:21.488 --> 00:59:24.655
(audience applauding)

00:59:40.469 --> 00:59:43.552
