01:01:04.036 --> 01:01:09.036
♪ But because I knew you ♪

01:01:10.897 --> 01:01:14.814
♪ I have been changed for good ♪

01:01:21.087 --> 01:01:24.953
♪ It well may be ♪

01:01:24.953 --> 01:01:28.668
