01:01:28.668 --> 01:01:31.541
♪ In this lifetime ♪

01:01:31.541 --> 01:01:34.972
♪ So let me say before we part ♪

01:01:34.972 --> 01:01:38.467
♪ So much of me ♪

01:01:38.467 --> 01:01:42.263
♪ Is made of what I learned from you ♪

01:01:42.263 --> 01:01:45.735
♪ You'll be with me ♪

01:01:45.735 --> 01:01:50.092
♪ Like a handprint on my heart ♪

01:01:50.092 --> 01:01:55.092
♪ And now whatever way our stories end ♪

01:01:56.062 --> 01:01:59.220
♪ I know you have re-written mine ♪

01:01:59.220 --> 01:02:03.838
