01:02:23.334 --> 01:02:27.413
♪ But because I knew you ♪

01:02:27.413 --> 01:02:30.421
♪ Because I knew you ♪

01:02:30.421 --> 01:02:35.421
♪ I have been changed for good ♪

01:02:36.184 --> 01:02:39.174
♪ And just to clear the air ♪

01:02:39.174 --> 01:02:41.323
♪ I ask forgiveness ♪

01:02:41.323 --> 01:02:46.323
♪ For the things I've
done you blame me for ♪

01:02:46.507 --> 01:02:51.507
♪ But then I guess we know
there's blame to share ♪

01:02:51.825 --> 01:02:56.825
♪ And none of it seems to matter anymore ♪

01:02:57.989 --> 01:03:00.010
♪ Like a comet pulled from orbit ♪

