01:03:08.607 --> 01:03:11.148
♪ Halfway through the wood ♪

01:03:11.148 --> 01:03:14.526
♪ Who can say ♪

01:03:14.526 --> 01:03:19.526
♪ If I've been changed for the better ♪

01:03:20.658 --> 01:03:25.658
♪ I do believe I have been
changed for the better ♪

01:03:29.313 --> 01:03:34.313
♪ And because I knew you ♪

01:03:34.564 --> 01:03:39.042
♪ Because I knew you ♪

01:03:39.042 --> 01:03:44.042
♪ Because I knew you ♪

01:03:44.255 --> 01:03:49.255
♪ I have been changed ♪

01:03:52.528 --> 01:03:54.778
♪ For good ♪

01:04:02.025 --> 01:04:06.275
(audience cheering and applauding)

01:04:26.264 --> 01:04:27.847
- Alright, alright.

01:04:33.420 --> 01:04:35.073
Okay, alright.

01:04:39.690 --> 01:04:42.853
Alright.
(audience laughing)

01:04:44.240 --> 01:04:45.500
Yes, exactly.

01:04:45.500 --> 01:04:46.950
We need to, we're resilient.

01:04:46.950 --> 01:04:49.480
We respond to changes of circumstance.

01:04:49.480 --> 01:04:54.050
Okay, Shades of Yale is
certainly among the most

01:04:54.050 --> 01:04:57.840
recognized and most
popular groups of Yale.

01:04:57.840 --> 01:05:00.540
Their name celebrates
the group's diversity

01:05:00.540 --> 01:05:04.630
and the depth and complexity
of the black experience.

01:05:04.630 --> 01:05:07.460
At a moment like this,
when we are honoring

01:05:07.460 --> 01:05:11.467
the trailblazing women of the
classes of 1971, '72, and '73,

01:05:13.360 --> 01:05:16.810
and all they did to overcome,

01:05:16.810 --> 01:05:21.330
how could we not have Shades
sing their signature song?

01:05:21.330 --> 01:05:24.010
It will be followed by a special thank you

01:05:24.010 --> 01:05:28.473
video tribute from women
who are now at Yale.

01:05:29.980 --> 01:05:33.740
So, women of Yale Collage who
were the first on this campus,

01:05:33.740 --> 01:05:36.307
please help us welcome Shades.

01:05:36.307 --> 01:05:40.557
(audience cheering and applauding)

