♪ Some day ♪

01:07:15.987 --> 01:07:18.837
♪ Some day ♪

01:07:18.837 --> 01:07:20.904
♪ Sisters and brothers ♪

01:07:20.904 --> 01:07:23.904
♪ We shall overcome ♪

