01:21:38.060 --> 01:21:39.860
- Will you not celebrate with us

01:21:39.860 --> 01:21:42.980
the hands that have built our futures?

01:21:42.980 --> 01:21:46.040
These women, straight
backed and bright eyed

01:21:46.040 --> 01:21:48.770
in the black and white photographs,

01:21:48.770 --> 01:21:51.100
their arms and books a shield,

01:21:51.100 --> 01:21:53.570
their knowledge, their power.

01:21:53.570 --> 01:21:56.130
These women are mothers,

01:21:56.130 --> 01:22:00.020
their brightness echoing
off these stony walls.

01:22:00.020 --> 01:22:04.140
You are the portraits on
the walls of Sterling,

01:22:04.140 --> 01:22:07.880
gazing proudly with your
telescopes and chemistry.

01:22:07.880 --> 01:22:10.170
When first I walked in with my father,

01:22:10.170 --> 01:22:13.900
I was drawn to you, looked
up to your portraits

01:22:13.900 --> 01:22:18.140
and smiled and said, "This
is why I'm here today."

01:22:18.140 --> 01:22:21.830
These women who raised their
hands and raised their fists.

01:22:21.830 --> 01:22:26.120
super women with raised
fists, you've raised us.

01:22:26.120 --> 01:22:30.420
This is not a milestone
but a beginning again.

01:22:30.420 --> 01:22:33.620
It is a reminder that we
women are not guests here.

01:22:33.620 --> 01:22:37.290
We are the very backbone
of this institution.

01:22:37.290 --> 01:22:40.463
All 2800 from 230,

01:22:41.460 --> 01:22:43.380
you bring us together.

01:22:43.380 --> 01:22:46.050
And we are the light and the lightning.

01:22:46.050 --> 01:22:49.060
We are the cracking of
book spines and boldness.

01:22:49.060 --> 01:22:52.340
We are bravery and strength.

01:22:52.340 --> 01:22:55.900
This is woman to woman.

01:22:55.900 --> 01:22:59.230
This is to 1969,

01:22:59.230 --> 01:23:02.633
to trailblazers, to path breakers.

01:23:03.730 --> 01:23:07.500
Woman to woman, we see you.

01:23:07.500 --> 01:23:08.747
We are you.

01:23:09.640 --> 01:23:11.519
We thank you.

01:23:11.519 --> 01:23:15.769
(audience cheering and applauding)

01:23:43.800 --> 01:23:46.310
And now, would everyone
please stay standing

01:23:46.310 --> 01:23:47.953
for "Bright College Years."

01:23:47.953 --> 01:23:49.100
(audience laughing)

01:23:49.100 --> 01:23:52.017
Led by the Yale Precision Marching Band.

01:23:52.017 --> 01:23:53.590
The words are on the back of your program,

01:23:53.590 --> 01:23:54.730
and you should all have the white

01:23:54.730 --> 01:23:56.020
handkerchief to wave at the end.

01:23:56.020 --> 01:23:58.570
And we'll get started once
they're all in the room.

01:23:59.694 --> 01:24:02.861
